---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {
  EMAIL,
  EMAIL_URL,
  GITHUB_URL,
  HANDLE,
  LINKEDIN_URL,
  PERSON_NAME,
} from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`About ${PERSON_NAME} | ${HANDLE}.`}>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>I am the founder of <a href="https://mhsbsolutions.com">MHSB</a>, a consultancy in Greenville, SC that helps law firms get their technology right. We do Lawmatics implementations, CRM integrations, workflow automation, and (increasingly) AI adoption for firms of all sizes.</p>
    <p>Before MHSB, I spent time in the weeds of legal operations: intake pipelines, practice management software, billing integrations, the kind of infrastructure that nobody sees until it breaks. That work taught me that the real leverage in legal tech is not in the flashy tools but in the boring connective tissue between systems.</p>
    <p>This site is my personal notebook. I write about things I am figuring out, problems I have run into, and ideas I want to pressure-test in public. Some of it is about legal technology specifically. Some of it is about building a business around a regulated vertical. All of it is honest about what I do not know yet.</p>
    <p>The case studies here have been anonymized. I work under NDA with most of my clients, so I describe the shape of the problem and the architecture of the solution without identifying anyone.</p>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <ul class="contact-list">
      <li>Email: <a href={EMAIL_URL}>{EMAIL}</a></li>
      <li><a href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href={LINKEDIN_URL}>LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li>Company: <a href="https://mhsbsolutions.com">mhsbsolutions.com</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
